# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
packages/typst_flutter/.typst_flutter_prebuilt/
packages/typst_flutter/rust/target/
packages/tylog_import_core/target/
packages/typst_flutter/.native-build*/
packages/typst_flutter/macos/typst_flutter/.build/
